summary: Verify preview repository opt-in
description: >-
  Opt in to a disabled Azure Linux Preview Base repository for one DNF5 operation
test: ./test.sh
duration: 5m
require+:
- dnf5
- sudo
- shadow-utils
- util-linux
- gawk
- grep
- coreutils
extra-azurelinux-test:
  scenario: pkg:azurelinux-repos/preview-package-access
